    "facts": "The complainants have filed the present complaint alleging willful disobedience of the order dated 19.08.2025 passed by a Coordinate Bench of this Court in Writ Petition No.24182/2025 (S- KSAT). Apparently, a memo has been filed enclosing therewith an order dated 03.11.2025, whereby the Commissioner, Food and Drugs Administration, Bengaluru, has passed an order directing the - 10 - NC: 2026:KHC:3409-DB HC-KAR petitioners/complainants to continue as Food Safety Officers in the Commissionerate of Food Safety, till the disposal of the application pending before the Hon'ble Karnataka Appellate Tribunal. It is the complainants case that there is an inordinate delay in passing the order, which has effectively deprived them of the salary.",
